---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="NO BALL GAMES Community | Collectors, Artists, FRET and the Movement"
  description="Join the NO BALL GAMES community: collect original art and painted clothing, contribute to the XRP KIDs universe, join the FRET resistance and build the movement."
  current="community"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Community</span>
    <h1>Built by people who still play anyway.</h1>
    <p>
      NO BALL GAMES is a movement, not just a brand. Collectors, artists, lore contributors and FRET members — everyone who refuses to stay behind the sign belongs here.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section split-grid">
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">The FRET connection</span>
      <h2>Fresh Rapid Elite Team energy.</h2>
      <p>
        In the XRP KIDs universe, FRET is the grassroots resistance built around the 11 free KIDs: artists, coders, collectors, signal runners and players who know the city's back routes and refuse to let the culture be captured.
      </p>
      <p>
        That energy is real outside the lore too. The NO BALL GAMES community moves fast, builds with purpose, supports culture and keeps the signal authentic.
      </p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}lore/`}>Explore the FRET lore →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">How to get involved</span>
      <h2>Collect. Create. Build. Play.</h2>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li><strong>Collectors:</strong> follow physical art, painted clothing and XRP KIDs drops.</li>
        <li><strong>Artists:</strong> bring original work and collaboration proposals.</li>
        <li><strong>Lore contributors:</strong> build out character pages, timelines and the universe.</li>
        <li><strong>Fans:</strong> follow the XRP KIDs arc, join FRET and be part of the New Dawn.</li>
        <li><strong>Brand partners:</strong> bring Grime Art collaboration and activation ideas.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section card-grid">
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Collectors</span>
      <h3>Collect the story</h3>
      <p>Original Grime Art paintings, hand-painted jackets and XRP KIDs digital collectibles. Pieces with provenance, lore and the mark of a human hand.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}collections/`}>View collections →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Artists</span>
      <h3>Bring real work</h3>
      <p>Submit ideas rooted in street culture, painted craft and the NO BALL GAMES visual world. No corporate fluff. No pretend rebellion. Real work only.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}contact/`}>Submit artist enquiry →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">XRP KIDs / FRET</span>
      <h3>Join the resistance</h3>
      <p>Be part of the XRP KIDs universe. Follow the FRET arc, track the New Dawn timeline and engage with the 11 free KIDs lore as the story expands.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}xrp/`}>Enter the XRP universe →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Brand partners</span>
      <h3>Activate with Grime Art</h3>
      <p>Bring brand activation ideas, campaign concepts and collaboration briefs that fit the NO BALL GAMES cultural world — and leave the corporate polish at the door.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}contact/`}>Discuss collaboration →</a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-block">
    <div class="cta-block-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Join the movement</span>
      <h2>Collect, create, build, play.</h2>
      <p>Whether you are here for the art, the lore or the community — there is a clear lane for your role in the NO BALL GAMES universe.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${base}contact/`}>Get in touch</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}collections/`}>Explore collections</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
